        "content": [
          {
            "citations": null,
            "text": "# Two Key Aspects of Encryption\n\n1. **Confidentiality**\n   - Encryption transforms readable data (plaintext) into an unreadable format (ciphertext) to protect sensitive information from unauthorized access\n   - Ensures that only parties with the correct decryption key can access the original data\n\n2. **Authentication/Integrity**\n   - Encryption can verify the identity of the sender and ensure data hasn't been tampered with during transmission\n   - Uses cryptographic keys to confirm that messages come from legitimate sources and remain unchanged",
